WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.100
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.100
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.530
Set first and second wings.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.410
Standby for takeoff!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:45.660
X-Tornado, taking off!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:50.210
Takeoff!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:57.340
Retracting landing gear. Set third and fourth wings.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.060
Bon voyage.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:07.100
I wonder if they'll be able to find the last Chaos Emerald?

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.810
I hope they find it before Dr. Eggman does.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:15.110
I hope they find it quickly so that you can see your mother again.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.190
Yes!

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.030
Any sign of the Chaos Emerald?

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:23.950
Not yet.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.200
Alright, let's find it!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.460
C'mon Chris, you have to search too!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.010
Yeah.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:42.910
Episode 25

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:42.910
The Last Chaos Emerald

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:02.570
How can he keep watching that without getting bored?

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.160
Really.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.410
Dr. Eggman must be very happy.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:15.420
Luck is finally on my side. At this rate, I'll be the one to get the last Chaos Emerald.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.670
Here.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:19.840
I know what I'm choosing today, so I don't need the cards.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.410
That's a lame robot.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.910
Even we're more useful.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:54.250
Not so fast! I'm confident that E-77 will find the last Chaos Emerald.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:06.140
Listen. At first, I also thought he was a dud, but it turns out he's endowed with incredible power. That power is...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.350
That power is...?

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.850
Luck.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.730
Luck?

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:15.230
Yes, luck. He is a strangely lucky mecha.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:19.230
E-77, I'm expecting to hear good news.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:29.030
Glow, Chaos Emerald. Find the last one.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:36.670
I must return to my world as soon as possible. I'm worried about the Master Emerald. Furthermore, what did that voice mean...

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:41.050
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:47.300
The Chaos Emeralds hold all the answers. However...

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.850
Sonic has four.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.890
Eggman has one.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:05:01.320
With the one I have, that makes six total. Even if I find the last one, will we ever manage to get all seven together?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.570
Sonic and Eggman must reconcile.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:09.030
It's not in my nature, but I'm the only one who can pull that off.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.120
What is that?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.260
Are you Eggman's robot?

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.010
Why are you here?

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.690
That's Egg Fort II.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:42.320
That's why this led me here.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.290
That's all for today.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.620
Hooray!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.790
Chris, let's have lunch.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.170
Chris! It's lunch time!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:08.340
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm not hungry.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.640
We'll go ahead then.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.560
Okay, I'm sorry.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:19.730
Chris, you don't look well. Let's go to the infirmary.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.480
No, I'm fine.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.480
I think you should. Come on.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.440
Okay.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.700
Relax.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.820
Okay.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.790
Tell me how you feel right now.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:41.880
I feel depressed, as if something is squeezing my heart.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.960
Like you can't forgive yourself?

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.000
Yes.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:54.560
There are two Chrises. One Chris feels that he has to let Sonic return to his world. The other Chris doesn't want to part with Sonic.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:07:00.020
Each Chris condemns the other Chris.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:04.360
Mr. Stewart, what should I do?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.360
Give me your hand.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.070
Eat it.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.830
Okay.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:21.620
Is it good?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.880
Yes.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:27.590
That delicious candy will eventually melt and disappear.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:31.590
But the memory of its great taste remains.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.590
Yes.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:38.520
That's what growing up is all about.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:49.860
Yes.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:54.110
Teacher, this is a routine check-in. Any changes?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:58.450
Well... Actually, everything's the same.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:08.550
The seven Chaos Emeralds created Chaos Control, causing all of you to arrive in this world.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.260
Yes.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:19.350
Which means if we create another Chaos Control, we can send Dr. Eggman away from our world.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.390
Wait a second.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:29.610
We must first research what Chaos Control will do to our world.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.780
Silence!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.950
It's fine. Continue.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:41.410
Even Eggman couldn't prevent the Chaos Emeralds from going out of control. Isn't that right, Rouge?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:42.960
I guess so.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:52.590
If Chaos Control is capable of producing that much energy, there's a chance for large-scale disaster.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:59.010
So until we learn more, we should prevent anyone from gathering all the Chaos Emeralds?

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.890
Exactly.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.990
I'm home.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:17.240
Chris, welcome home.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.070
Where are Sonic and the others?

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:27.370
They left to search for the Chaos Emeralds again. Grandpa went into town to buy machine parts.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.090
So I finally was able to clean this room.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.390
No one's home.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:52.520
Before Sonic arrived, this was how things used to be.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.500
Sonic.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.500
Hey.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.260
Knuckles, what's up?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.760
I'm in a bit of a fix.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.760
What's with that robot?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.600
It's been following me ever since I helped it.

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:30.770
It's one of Eggman's robots, but he probably threw it out because it was useless. It's not evil.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.980
Anyway, I came to see Sonic.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:38.530
Sonic's out right now.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:45.370
Then pass along this message: I want him to reconcile with Eggman in order to create Chaos Control.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.370
What? You must be kidding!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:49.370
I'm serious.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.580
Why all of the sudden?

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:58.800
It's the only way to return to my world. I have a mission I must carry out.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:03.010
I'm sure Sonic also wants to return to his world.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:07.060
Chris, we have our own world to live in.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:10.850
We can't waste our time here forever.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:16.690
That's right. If I was Sonic, I would want to return to my own world.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.440
I understand. I'll pass along your message!

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:22.450
I'm going to visit Eggman.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.320
Do you know where he is?

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:29.080
Yeah. I randomly found him at Forest Hill. See ya.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.090
Knuckles!

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.050
Take me with you.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.670
Sure.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:50.680
The train is the fastest way to Forest Hill.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:54.400
The train for Forest Hill will be departing shortly.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.860
Let's hurry!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:35.440
Don't worry. I'll protect you.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:46.370
Since we were in a rish, we left it behind. It's probably still at the train station.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.250
Huh?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.250
Dr. Eggman, it's the enemy!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.130
Attack!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.630
Hold it!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.050
Dr. Eggman?

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.670
Look at that.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:26.450
So that's the story. Dr. Eggman, unless we all cooperate, none of us can return to our world.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:31.700
There's no point in each of us having our own Chaos Emeralds. Do you understand?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:39.710
I understand. I do understand, Knuckles. You're exactly right.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:46.260
I wonder why I never realized it before! You've opened my eyes!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.340
Thank you, Knuckles!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.930
Same here, Dr. Eggman.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.220
However, there is one condition.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.480
What is it?

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.850
Let me hold the Chaos Emeralds.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.270
Well…

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.860
You don't trust me?

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:10.990
We can only cooperate if we trust each other. Am I wrong, Knuckles?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.410
Knuckles…

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.450
You're right.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.920
You never let me down, Knuckles. I'm counting on you.

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:27.340
This is how it should be. Now Sonic can return to his world.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:36.480
Unlike that rebellious Sonic, Knuckles is honest. Honest to a fault!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.230
You mean...

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:43.900
All the Chaos Emeralds will soon come to me! When that happens...

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.880
Oh Vivian, why did you leave me?

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.100
I'll introduce you to a nice girl.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.060
Alright!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.610
Vivian?

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.990
Vivian!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:42.420
It's the final segment. Everybody, dance with me!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:49.920
Good-Good-Good-Good Morning...

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.590
I'm home.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.430
What happened? You're late.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:03.150
I'm sorry. I was over at a friend's house. Anyway, how was your search for the Chaos Emerald?

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:05.110
We couldn't find it.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:09.360
Thank goodness. Oops, that's now what I meant.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.740
What's wrong?

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.120
The next show won't be airing next week.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:20.620
I see.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.000
We'll find the Chaos Emerald, won't we?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.840
Yes, we will.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.380
I think I'll go for a walk.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.850
Wait, Sonic!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.850
What's up with Chris?

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:43.890
What did you say?

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:49.770
You want to return to your world as soon as possible, right?

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:53.280
Maybe, maybe not. So what did you want?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.370
Oh, Mr. Stewart says hi.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.660
I see!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:09.090
I'm sure Sonic wants to go home. There's no reason why he wouldn't want to. Therefore…

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.550
Did you bring them?

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:17.970
Yes, but I couldn't tell Sonic and the others.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:24.940
We're not doing anything bad. When we're done, I'm sure Sonic will be grateful. Let's go.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:47.080
The signal originated around here. Be careful!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.040
How brave.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:54.510
Don't you dare fly around on your own either!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:58.510
Fine. By the way, about the thing you're looking for…

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.980
That's...

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.310
This is Topaz.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:15.280
Mr. President! We found Eggman's base!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.820
Execute the plan.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:25.250
Tell Area 99 that it's time to dispatch the 'Beetle.'

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.410
Wait for orders.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.830
Okay.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:30.790
Huh?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.760
What are those two doing there?

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.760
I'm home.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.140
What's up?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.350
Big trouble. Chris...

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:50.730
Chris?

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.570
'I have the Chaos Emeralds.'

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:57.820
'Trust me. I'll make sure you return to your world.'

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:02.370
Chris left this message and went somewhere.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.830
Let's go find Chris.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:14.880
You want to return to your world as soon as possible, right?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:20.880
It's bad. The Chaos Emerald inside the X-Tornado is also missing. We can't use the second stage engine!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.140
Sonic?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.630
Good morning, my friends.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.390
We brought them.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.260
Show me what's inside.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:15.980
Those are the Chaos Emeralds! And now my Chaos Emerald.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:22.780
You know what's inside without looking, right? Because if we open the lid, things can get out of hand.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.030
I do.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.530
Good.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:31.870
Oh, this boy boarded the train for Forest Hill a little while ago.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.540
Forest Hill?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.250
I will keep them in a safe place.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.500
Let's trust him.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.130
Dr. Eggman.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:45.260
There's a phone call for you from E-77.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:52.680
What? You found the last Chaos Emerald?

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.150
Good work! I'll be right over! Stay right there!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.770
Eggman, is that true?

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:04.530
It's true. That's why E-77 is my mecha masterpiece!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.240
Did he say that before?

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:08.660
I don't think so.

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:11.200
Now all seven are together!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.120
We did it, Knuckles!

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:16.420
Yeah, now we can return home.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:19.790
Alright... Decoe, Bocoe!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.920
Okay!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:27.090
Knuckles! Why did you do that, Eggman?

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:37.690
You dimwit! Did you really think I was homesick?

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:46.910
My goal is to create the Eggman Empire. I don't care where - I'm fine with building it on this world!

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:50.200
That's horrible! You tricked us, Eggman!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.000
Egg Fort II, launch!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.290
Aye!

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:05.050
They're taking off.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.510
Emergency alert! Emergency alert!

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:16.350
Chris!

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:25.400
Where's Chris?

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:29.860
Sonic? Chris is still in there with the Chaos Emeralds.

00:22:29.860 --> 00:22:31.240
What?

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.290
I'm going ahead!

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.460
I'm counting on you, Sonic!

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.460
Chris...

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.380 --> 00:25:35.360
Birth! Super Sonic
